{"id":"d061a7977fcae989","group":"14","path":"14/14-df-monoid-action-sieve-classifier.md","title":"Definition — 幺半群作用拓扑斯的真值为右理想","display":"Definition — 幺半群作用拓扑斯的真值为右理想","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-df-monoid-action-sieve-classifier","aliases":["14-df-monoid-action-sieve-classifier"],"display":"Definition — 幺半群作用拓扑斯的真值为右理想","source_ref":"I.4, pp.35–38","source_status":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。","verification_status":"assistant-semantic-review; not-proof-assistant-checked","depends_on":["[[14-df-subobject-classifier]]","[[14-df-algebraic-structures]]","[[14-df-presheaf-sieve-classifier]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-df-monoid-action-sieve-classifier"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-df-monoid-action-sieve-classifier</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Definition — 幺半群作用拓扑斯的真值为右理想"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"I.4, pp.35–38"},{"key":"source_status","html":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"assistant-semantic-review; not-proof-assistant-checked"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a0c7f4bf5e51d4b5\" href=\"?note=a0c7f4bf5e51d4b5\" title=\"14-df-subobject-classifier\">14-df-subobject-classifier</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4d1aca1534bd822e\" href=\"?note=4d1aca1534bd822e\" title=\"14-df-algebraic-structures\">14-df-algebraic-structures</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e1782799288dd0ec\" href=\"?note=e1782799288dd0ec\" title=\"14-df-presheaf-sieve-classifier\">14-df-presheaf-sieve-classifier</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\in\\mathcal U\">\\(M\\in\\mathcal U\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu,e\">\\(\\mu,e\\)</span> 满足 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4d1aca1534bd822e\" href=\"?note=4d1aca1534bd822e\" title=\"14-df-algebraic-structures\">14-df-algebraic-structures</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{IsMonoid}(M,\\mu,e)\">\\(\\operatorname{IsMonoid}(M,\\mu,e)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"mn:=\\mu(m,n)\">\\(mn:=\\mu(m,n)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K=(X,\\rho)\">\\(K=(X,\\rho)\\)</span> 为候选作用对象；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|K|=X\">\\(|K|=X\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho_K=\\rho\">\\(\\rho_K=\\rho\\)</span> 为有序对投影。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b_M\">\\(b_M\\)</span> 提取作用箭头的底层函数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K,L,H\">\\(K,L,H\\)</span> 为作用对象，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq|K|\">\\(A\\subseteq|K|\\)</span> 为作用稳定子集。下式定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"BM\">\\(BM\\)</span> 的六元组、终对象及真值对象；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\in\\mathcal I_M\">\\(I\\in\\mathcal I_M\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\in M\">\\(m\\in M\\)</span>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"*:=\\varnothing\">\\(*:=\\varnothing\\)</span>。分类子谓词采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a0c7f4bf5e51d4b5\" href=\"?note=a0c7f4bf5e51d4b5\" title=\"14-df-subobject-classifier\">14-df-subobject-classifier</a>，环境范畴为下式定义的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"BM\">\\(BM\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"O_M=\\{(X,\\rho)\\mid X\\in\\mathcal U\\land\\rho:X\\times M\\to X\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\forall m,n\\in M\\;(\\rho(x,e)=x\\land\\rho(\\rho(x,m),n)=\\rho(x,mn))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[O_M=\\{(X,\\rho)\\mid X\\in\\mathcal U\\land\\rho:X\\times M\\to X\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\forall m,n\\in M\\;(\\rho(x,e)=x\\land\\rho(\\rho(x,m),n)=\\rho(x,mn))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M_M=\\{(K,L,f)\\mid K,L\\in O_M\\land f:|K|\\to|L|\\land\\forall x\\in|K|\\;\\forall m\\in M\\;f(\\rho_K(x,m))=\\rho_L(f(x),m)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M_M=\\{(K,L,f)\\mid K,L\\in O_M\\land f:|K|\\to|L|\\land\\forall x\\in|K|\\;\\forall m\\in M\\;f(\\rho_K(x,m))=\\rho_L(f(x),m)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"d_M(K,L,f)=K,\\quad c_M(K,L,f)=L,\\quad b_M(K,L,f)=f,\\quad i_M(K)=(K,K,\\operatorname{id}_{|K|}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[d_M(K,L,f)=K,\\quad c_M(K,L,f)=L,\\quad b_M(K,L,f)=f,\\quad i_M(K)=(K,K,\\operatorname{id}_{|K|}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\gamma_M((L,H,g),(K,L,f))=(K,H,g\\circ f),\\quad BM=(O_M,M_M,d_M,c_M,i_M,\\gamma_M),\\quad\\operatorname{Hom}_{BM}(K,L)=\\{a\\in M_M:d_M(a)=K\\land c_M(a)=L\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\gamma_M((L,H,g),(K,L,f))=(K,H,g\\circ f),\\quad BM=(O_M,M_M,d_M,c_M,i_M,\\gamma_M),\\quad\\operatorname{Hom}_{BM}(K,L)=\\{a\\in M_M:d_M(a)=K\\land c_M(a)=L\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf1_M=(\\{*\\},\\{((*,m),*):m\\in M\\}),\\qquad\\mathcal I_M=\\{I\\subseteq M\\mid\\forall m\\in I\\;\\forall n\\in M\\;(mn\\in I)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbf1_M=(\\{*\\},\\{((*,m),*):m\\in M\\}),\\qquad\\mathcal I_M=\\{I\\subseteq M\\mid\\forall m\\in I\\;\\forall n\\in M\\;(mn\\in I)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\rho_{\\Omega}(I,m)=\\{n\\in M\\mid mn\\in I\\},\\quad\\Omega_M=(\\mathcal I_M,\\rho_\\Omega),\\quad\\operatorname{true}=(\\mathbf1_M,\\Omega_M,(*\\mapsto M)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\rho_{\\Omega}(I,m)=\\{n\\in M\\mid mn\\in I\\},\\quad\\Omega_M=(\\mathcal I_M,\\rho_\\Omega),\\quad\\operatorname{true}=(\\mathbf1_M,\\Omega_M,(*\\mapsto M)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\chi_A=(K,\\Omega_M,(x\\mapsto\\{m\\in M\\mid\\rho_K(x,m)\\in A\\})),\\qquad\\operatorname{IsSubobjectClassifier}_{BM}(\\Omega_M,\\operatorname{true}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\chi_A=(K,\\Omega_M,(x\\mapsto\\{m\\in M\\mid\\rho_K(x,m)\\in A\\})),\\qquad\\operatorname{IsSubobjectClassifier}_{BM}(\\Omega_M,\\operatorname{true}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega_M\">\\(\\Omega_M\\)</span> 的底集为右理想族，作用结构是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho_\\Omega\">\\(\\rho_\\Omega\\)</span>；以下 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\cdot m\">\\(I\\cdot m\\)</span> 指这一结构的值。分类子中的 true 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_A\">\\(\\chi_A\\)</span> 为带作用对象标签的箭头；下文 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_A(x)\">\\(\\chi_A(x)\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b_M(\\chi_A)(x)\">\\(b_M(\\chi_A)(x)\\)</span> 的简写。</p>\n<p>右理想即一个对象的幺半群范畴上的筛。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\cdot m\">\\(I\\cdot m\\)</span> 仍是右理想，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(I\\cdot m)\\cdot n=I\\cdot(mn)\">\\((I\\cdot m)\\cdot n=I\\cdot(mn)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_A(x)\">\\(\\chi_A(x)\\)</span> 是右理想且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_A(xm)=\\chi_A(x)\\cdot m\">\\(\\chi_A(xm)=\\chi_A(x)\\cdot m\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_A(x)=M\">\\(\\chi_A(x)=M\\)</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in A\">\\(x\\in A\\)</span>，检查单位元即可得反向。特征函数唯一性的证明与一般筛分类子相同。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 是群，非空右理想必为整个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span>，退化为两元素真值对象，与前一原子相符。</p>\n<p>来源：Mac Lane–Moerdijk，I.4, pp.35–38。此处来源定位沿用所附笔记；本次未获得所列原书文件。数学结构及必要条件以本条 Hypothesis 和 Assertion 为准。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-subobject-classifier","status":"resolved","id":"a0c7f4bf5e51d4b5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-subobject-classifier]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-algebraic-structures","status":"resolved","id":"4d1aca1534bd822e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-algebraic-structures]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-presheaf-sieve-classifier","status":"resolved","id":"e1782799288dd0ec","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-presheaf-sieve-classifier]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-algebraic-structures","status":"resolved","id":"4d1aca1534bd822e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$M\\in\\mathcal U$ 及 $\\mu,e$ 满足 [[14-df-algebraic-structures]] 的 $\\operatorname{IsMonoid}(M,\\mu,e)$；$mn:=\\mu(m,n)$。$K=(X,\\rho)$ 为候选作用对象；$|K|=X$、$\\rho_K=\\rho$ 为有序对投影。$b_M$ 提取作用箭头的底层函数。$K,L,H$ 为作用对象，$A\\subseteq|K|$ 为作用稳定子集。下式定义 $BM$ 的六元组、终对象及真值对象；$I\\in\\mathcal I_M$、$m\\in M$。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-subobject-classifier","status":"resolved","id":"a0c7f4bf5e51d4b5","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$*:=\\varnothing$。分类子谓词采用 [[14-df-subobject-classifier]]，环境范畴为下式定义的 $BM$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"M\\in\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu,e","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{IsMonoid}(M,\\mu,e)","display":false},{"tex":"mn:=\\mu(m,n)","display":false},{"tex":"K=(X,\\rho)","display":false},{"tex":"|K|=X","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho_K=\\rho","display":false},{"tex":"b_M","display":false},{"tex":"K,L,H","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq|K|","display":false},{"tex":"BM","display":false},{"tex":"I\\in\\mathcal I_M","display":false},{"tex":"m\\in M","display":false},{"tex":"*:=\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"BM","display":false},{"tex":"O_M=\\{(X,\\rho)\\mid X\\in\\mathcal U\\land\\rho:X\\times M\\to X\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\forall m,n\\in M\\;(\\rho(x,e)=x\\land\\rho(\\rho(x,m),n)=\\rho(x,mn))\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"M_M=\\{(K,L,f)\\mid K,L\\in O_M\\land f:|K|\\to|L|\\land\\forall x\\in|K|\\;\\forall m\\in M\\;f(\\rho_K(x,m))=\\rho_L(f(x),m)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"d_M(K,L,f)=K,\\quad c_M(K,L,f)=L,\\quad b_M(K,L,f)=f,\\quad i_M(K)=(K,K,\\operatorname{id}_{|K|}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\gamma_M((L,H,g),(K,L,f))=(K,H,g\\circ f),\\quad BM=(O_M,M_M,d_M,c_M,i_M,\\gamma_M),\\quad\\operatorname{Hom}_{BM}(K,L)=\\{a\\in M_M:d_M(a)=K\\land c_M(a)=L\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbf1_M=(\\{*\\},\\{((*,m),*):m\\in M\\}),\\qquad\\mathcal I_M=\\{I\\subseteq M\\mid\\forall m\\in I\\;\\forall n\\in M\\;(mn\\in I)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\rho_{\\Omega}(I,m)=\\{n\\in M\\mid mn\\in I\\},\\quad\\Omega_M=(\\mathcal I_M,\\rho_\\Omega),\\quad\\operatorname{true}=(\\mathbf1_M,\\Omega_M,(*\\mapsto M)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\chi_A=(K,\\Omega_M,(x\\mapsto\\{m\\in M\\mid\\rho_K(x,m)\\in A\\})),\\qquad\\operatorname{IsSubobjectClassifier}_{BM}(\\Omega_M,\\operatorname{true}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\Omega_M","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho_\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"I\\cdot m","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi_A","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi_A(x)","display":false},{"tex":"b_M(\\chi_A)(x)","display":false},{"tex":"I\\cdot m","display":false},{"tex":"(I\\cdot m)\\cdot n=I\\cdot(mn)","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi_A(x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi_A(xm)=\\chi_A(x)\\cdot m","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi_A(x)=M","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in A","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false}],"bytes":3026,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-299","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-monoid-action-sieve-classifier|df-200 — 幺半群作用拓扑斯的真值为右理想]]"},{"id":"af8af33cef1d96d9","anchor":"ref-22","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-monoid-action-sieve-classifier]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-147","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-monoid-action-sieve-classifier]]"},{"id":"ffda0c0482667c45","anchor":"ref-87","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[14-df-monoid-action-sieve-classifier]]"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-301","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-monoid-action-sieve-classifier|df-200 — 幺半群作用拓扑斯的真值为右理想]]"}],"outgoing":["a0c7f4bf5e51d4b5","4d1aca1534bd822e","e1782799288dd0ec"]}